<BRK/>
<TXT>Modify <RID>ASTM D4595</RID> for geogrids considering recommendations in <RID>GSI GRI GG6</RID>.  Express the tensile strength on a 
unit length basis by substituting n*a for Ws, where:</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<LST>Ws = specimen width, (<MET>mm</MET><ENG> inches</ENG>)</LST><BRK/>
<LST>n = number of ribs in the sample (must be a whole number)</LST><BRK/>
<LST>a = nominal rib spacing for the product tested, (<MET>mm</MET><ENG> inches</ENG>)</LST><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</PRT>   <END/><BRK/></SEC>